This repository contains documents that combine two layers:

1. OWASP AISVS requirement texts, which are the property of the OWASP
   Foundation and its contributors and are themselves licensed under
   CC BY-SA 4.0. Official source: https://github.com/OWASP/AISVS

2. An authoring and integration layer (audit questions, expected evidence,
   response criteria, cross-framework mappings, and the Evidence Freshness
   / Continuous Controls Monitoring model) added on top of that standard.

Both layers in this repository are made available under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License.

You are free to share and adapt the material for any purpose, provided you give
appropriate credit, indicate if changes were made, and distribute your
contributions under the same license.

The integration layer and the Evidence Freshness model do not imply endorsement
by the OWASP Foundation and are not an official crosswalk. The Evidence
Freshness annex is a design proposal presented for review, not a certification.

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode
